cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the derived dataset, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "biblical-books"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible, resumable extraction of Biblical Studies candidate records from the K10plus union
  catalogue, with a pandas-ready Parquet bibliography. Nine configured searches (DDC 22*, LCC BS*,
  GND and LCSH subject headings, and English/German/French title supplements) were harvested in full
  and exported as flat plus machine-readable tables: structured contributors with relator codes,
  parsed life dates and GND identifiers, and subject concepts merged across the German and English
  vocabularies. The harvest is not a validated academic corpus; see EXTRACTION.md for coverage,
  contributions of each search and known limitations.
authors:
